Inclusion Criteria:

1. Confirmed newly-diagnosed, treatment-naive ITP;
2. A platelet count \ 2 x ULN, or total bilirubin ≥1.5 x ULN 2) hemoglobin \<9 g/dL, or total white blood cell (WBC) count \<2,500/µL, or neutropenia (absolute neutrophil count \<1,200/µL), or lymphopenia (lymphocyte count \<750/µL) 3) eGFR \<50 mL/min/1.73 m\^2.

Inclusion Criteria:

1. Male or female aged 18 or above;
