Liver function: total bilirubin ≤ 1.5 × upper limit of normal (ULN), ALT and AST ≤ 2.5 × ULN;

Renal function: creatinine ≤ 1.5 × ULN;

Coagulation function: INR ≤ 1.5, APTT ≤ 1.5 × ULN;
