Inclusion Criteria:

* Male or female aged from 18 to 45 years old;
* Written informed consent;
* Healthy volunteers (without any ocular symptom);
* Normal ocular examination in both eyes (corrected visual acuity (VA) \>= 6/10 - slit lamp examination without clinical relevant abnormalities - tear break-up time (BUT) \>= 10 seconds - lachrymal secretion in the Schirmer test \>= 10 mm in 5 minutes - lissamine green test total score \ = 2, watering score \>= 2, folliculo-papillary conjunctivitis score \>= 2, number of fluorescein-stained punctuations \>= 10;
* Blepharitis, conjunctivitis, uveitis;
