2. Pittsburgh Sleep Quality Index(PSQI)\>7;
3. Aged 18-65 years old；

Exclusion Criteria:

1. Have taken drugs that may affect gastrointestinal motility and sleep in the past two week;
2. The history of gastrointestinal surgery;
