Inclusion Criteria:

1. Healthy male subjects aged 18 or above (including 18 years old) at the date of signing the informed consent;
2. Body weight ≥ 50kg, body mass index (BMI) within the range of 19 \~ 26kg /m2 (including 19 and 26 kg/m2) (BMI= weight (kg)/height 2 (m2));
